              "instruction": "tyā varṣī moṭhā duṣkāḷ paḍlā. — That year there was a great drought.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *tyā varṣī moṭhā duṣkāḷ paḍlā.* — That year there was a great drought.]"
